  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "もともと　オゾンそうに　すんでおり\nからだの　カラが　おもくなると\nちじょうに　むかって　おちてくる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "원래 오존층에 살고 있으며\n몸의 껍질이 무거워지면\n지상을 향해 떨어진다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "原本棲息在臭氧層，\n身體的外殼變重後，\n就會向著地面落下。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il vivait dans la couche d’ozone, avant que\nsa carapace, devenue trop lourde, ne finisse\npar le faire chuter sur la terre ferme.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Eigentlich lebt es in der Ozonschicht, doch\nwenn seine Schale zu schwer wird, stürzt es\nauf die Erde.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive en la capa de ozono hasta que su\ncaparazón se hace demasiado pesado y cae\nsin remisión a tierra firme.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive normalmente nello strato d’ozono, ma\nquando il guscio esterno si indurisce precipita\na terra.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Originally making its home in the ozone layer,\nit hurtles to the ground when the shell enclosing\nits body grows too heavy.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "もともと　オゾン層に　棲んでおり\n身体の　殻が　重くなると\n地上に　向かって　落ちてくる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "原本栖息在臭氧层，\n身体的外壳变重后，\n就会向着地面落下。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive en la capa de ozono hasta que su\ncaparazón se hace demasiado pesado y cae\nsin remisión a tierra firme.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "つよい　しょうげきを　うけると　カラは\nはがれ　おちる。　ナノりゅうしが\nとつぜんへんいし　うまれたポケモン。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "강한 충격을 받으면 껍데기는\n떨어져 나간다. 나노입자가\n돌연변이하여 태어난 포켓몬이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "若受到強烈的衝擊，外殼就會剝落。\n是奈米粒子突變而誕生的寶可夢。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La carapace qui le recouvre peut être arrachée\npar une violente attaque. Il est le fruit d’une\nmutation de nanoparticules.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Heftige Stöße lassen seine Schale abblättern.\nEine Mutation von Nanopartikeln brachte\ndieses Pokémon hervor.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Este Pokémon nació fruto de la mutación de\nnanopartículas. El caparazón que lo recubre\nse desprende al recibir un fuerte impacto.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha avuto origine da una mutazione improvvisa\ndi nanoparticelle. Un attacco violento può fargli\nperdere il guscio esterno.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Strong impacts can knock it out of its shell. This\nPokémon was born from mutated nanoparticles.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "強い　衝撃を　うけると　殻は\nはがれ　落ちる。　ナノ粒子が\n突然変異し　生まれたポケモン。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "如果受到强烈的冲击，外壳就会剥落。\n纳米粒子突变诞生而成的宝可梦。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Este Pokémon nació fruto de la mutación de\nnanopartículas. El caparazón que lo recubre\nse desprende al recibir un fuerte impacto.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "オゾンそうに　すみ　より　つよい\nポケモンの　エサに　なっている。\nにげるうちに　ちじょうに　おちてくる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "오존층에 살며 더 강한\n포켓몬의 먹이가 된다.\n도망치다 지상으로 떨어진다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "棲息在臭氧層，被更強大的\n寶可夢當成了食物。\n在逃跑的過程中落到了地上。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il vit dans la couche d’ozone, où des Pokémon\nplus forts que lui cherchent à le manger.\nIl tombe à terre lorsqu’il tente de s’enfuir.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es lebt in der Ozonschicht und dient stärkeren\nPokémon als Nahrung. Wenn es vor ihnen flieht,\nstürzt es auf die Oberfläche des Planeten.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive en la capa de ozono, donde puede resultar\npresa de Pokémon más fuertes. Al huir, acaba\nprecipitándose a tierra firme.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive nello strato d’ozono, dove Pokémon più\nforti di lui lo cacciano per cibarsene. Spesso\nprecipita sulla terraferma cercando di fuggire.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It lives in the ozone layer, where it becomes\nfood for stronger Pokémon. When it tries to run\naway, it falls to the ground.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "オゾン層に　棲み　より　強い\nポケモンの　エサに　なっている。\n逃げるうちに　地上に　おちてくる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
