    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "がいかくは　とても　がんじょうだが\nちじょうに　らっかする　ショックで\nこっぱみじんに　くだけてしまう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "겉껍질은 매우 튼튼하지만\n지상에 낙하할 때의 충격으로\n산산이 조각나 버린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "外殼非常堅固，\n但墜落到地上時的衝擊\n會讓牠碎成細屑。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sa carapace, pourtant très solide, éclate\nen mille morceaux quand il s’écrase sur\nla terre en tombant du ciel.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Seine äußere Schale ist zwar sehr robust, durch\nden Aufprall auf der Oberfläche des Planeten\nzersplittert sie allerdings.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lo recubre un duro caparazón que se quiebra\nen pedazos al impactar con la superficie de la\ntierra.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il suo guscio esterno è estremamente resistente,\nma quando precipita dallo strato d’ozono\nl’impatto con il suolo lo fa andare in mille pezzi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
